# Build context is the repo root (docker build -f environment/Dockerfile .).
# Exclude everything not needed for the image to keep the context small + cache-friendly.
**/.git
**/target
**/.slim
**/dev-docs
**/docs
**/tests
**/admin-ui
**/*.rs
**/Cargo.toml
**/Cargo.lock
**/.github
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.md
**/.gitignore
**/.ignore
**/node_modules

# KEEP the staged binary (build.sh writes it here):
!bin/
!bin/hydra
